  "notes": "LRCGET desktop app (likely Tauri) running in a browser. Mostly monochrome white UI with one hot-pink accent (#f35697) used for the primary 'Download all lyrics' pill, the big round play button, the slider thumbs/tracks and row-icon hover fills. All buttons are pills (radius 9999px); the round back button is grey. Lyrics status is shown as tiny pills: green 'Synced', near-black 'Plain', and a multicolor gradient 'Word Synced' (one of the page's 4 gradients). Rows have no dividers and get a light grey hover. The album list stays in the DOM, hidden behind the album detail view. Beyond the 11 rows, the extra height in the full capture is empty because the panel was stretched for the tall screenshot. Player bar #fafafa with a faint pink seek track (#ffd9e2)."
